WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:04.000
This was never of your son's doing.

00:05.120 --> 00:09.000
Were it possible, your son would gladly trade his life for Imperial Father's enduring peace!

00:09.040 --> 00:13.000
My Prince, what foolish words are you uttering?!

00:13.520 --> 00:17.500
Mother believes you! Mother knows your filial heart.
